# The Four Musketeers section 1 in Bastok Mines: Rashid's own script plays the gate guards' mission list 1001; its
# finish with option 0 does nothing, with option 10 begins the mission and says YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION; then the
# mission's 1002.
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/Ayame/onTrigger Metalworks/Iron_Eater/onTrigger Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/Naji/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/715 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001 Beadeaux/Copper_Quadav/onMobDeath Beadeaux/onZoneIn/1 Beadeaux/onEventFinish/120 PashhowMarshlands/onZoneIn/1 PashhowMarshlands/onEventFinish/10 PashhowMarshlands/onEventFinish/11
char zone=BastokMines pos=-8.4,-1,-121 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheEmissary completed
login
trigger Rashid                            # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 10: nothing
trigger Rashid
finish option=10                        # begun
trigger Rashid                            # 1002
finish-if-event
